# # Task 1: LSTM Autoencoder for Single‑Genre Music Generation (MAESTRO) – FIXED for Audible MIDI
#
# This notebook implements an unsupervised LSTM Autoencoder that learns to reconstruct
# short piano‑roll windows (8 seconds) from the MAESTRO dataset. After training, new
# music is generated by sampling latent vectors from N(0, I).
#
# **Fixes for silent outputs:**
# - Higher α=0.95 in Focal Loss (strong push for note cells)
# - Generation threshold = 0.05 + probability scaling (×2.0)
# - Minimum note duration = 0.001 seconds

